WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.559
Recovery is part of performance, not a reward after performance.

00:00:03.559 --> 00:00:07.018
Constant output eventually reduces quality because attention, judgment, emotional control,

00:00:07.018 --> 00:00:08.748
and creativity all need renewal.

00:00:08.748 --> 00:00:12.899
Recovery can be short or long, active or quiet, individual or social.

00:00:12.899 --> 00:00:16.358
The important idea is that recovery belongs inside the system.

00:00:16.358 --> 00:00:20.855
If it is always postponed until everything is complete, it may never happen.

00:00:20.855 --> 00:00:23.277
Breaks create transitions that help attention reset.

00:00:23.277 --> 00:00:26.390
A useful break does not have to be elaborate.

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:31.233
It may mean stepping away from the screen, moving briefly, getting water, changing posture,

00:00:31.233 --> 00:00:34.692
or closing a loop before moving to a new task.

00:00:34.692 --> 00:00:40.227
Sleep matters at a general level because people need adequate rest to sustain judgment and learning,

00:00:40.227 --> 00:00:44.378
but this course does not provide sleep treatment guidance or clinical advice.

00:00:44.378 --> 00:00:45.416
Movement, hydration, nutrition,

00:00:45.416 --> 00:00:49.221
and emotional decompression can all support capacity in broad practical ways.

00:00:49.221 --> 00:00:53.718
The goal is not to prescribe a diet, supplement protocol, or performance hack.

00:00:53.718 --> 00:00:59.252
It is to recognize that people do better when basic needs are not treated as optional.

00:00:59.252 --> 00:01:04.441
A demanding work system that ignores the body and emotions will eventually pay through errors,

00:01:04.441 --> 00:01:05.825
conflict, and lower-quality execution.

00:01:05.825 --> 00:01:07.900
Transitions between tasks are especially valuable.

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:12.051
Going straight from an intense meeting into a complex decision may preserve

00:01:12.051 --> 00:01:14.127
calendar efficiency while reducing judgment quality.

00:01:14.127 --> 00:01:18.278
A short transition can capture action items, clear the workspace, reset attention,

00:01:18.278 --> 00:01:20.353
and make the next start cleaner.

00:01:20.353 --> 00:01:23.121
Energy renewal is not about avoiding hard work.

00:01:23.121 --> 00:01:26.580
It is about making hard work sustainable enough to repeat.
